      "title": "商的计算",
      "problem": "求 $f(x)=(x+1)/(x-1)$ 的导数。",
      "steps": [
        "u=x+1，v=x−1，u′=v′=1。",
        "分子为 (x−1)−(x+1)=−2。"
      ],
      "answer": "$f\\prime(x)=-2/(x-1)^2$，x≠1。"
    }
  ],
